  "description": "DIGQOB crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C96 H84 Gd4 N32 O8,6(C1 H4 O1),6(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 4 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 4 O neighbors; Gd1A (Gd) has 4 O neighbors; Gd2A (Gd) has 4 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.775-3.786 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 108.47-112.33°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [(L4-2H)4Gd4(OCH3)4](CH3CN)6(CH3OH)6.",
